<div><button itchio aria-label="Click to activate YouTube embed" type="button" class="embed_preload youtube_preload" data-embed_code="&lt;iframe src=&quot;//www.youtube.com/embed/G96H8Bw6RZI&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;500&quot; height=&quot;281&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;" style="width: 250px; height: 140px; background: url(https://i.ytimg.com/vi/G96H8Bw6RZI/hqdefault.jpg) 50% 50% no-repeat; background-size: cover"></button></div>
<p>--------------------<br></p>
<p><em>Alright, Mr. Thade. You&#x27;re here for your wife, I&#x27;m here for a good, efficient programmer. Do we have an understanding?</em></p>
<p>--------------------</p>
<p><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzUzNzYyMjgucG5n/original/aJu8ff.png" loading="lazy"><br></p>
<p>--------------------</p>
<ul><li>Program using only 3 commands.</li><li>Solve and optimize 32 Tasks and 16 Extra Tasks.</li><li>Find out more details about your wife.</li><li>Regret that incident long, long ago.</li><li><strong><em>NEW!</em></strong> Accomplishments, ranging from boring to confusing!</li><li><strong><em>NEW!</em></strong> Custom task editor to keep you working forever, and ever.</li></ul>
<p>--------------------</p>
<p><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzUzNzYyMjkucG5n/original/QxRXio.png" loading="lazy"><br></p>
<p>--------------------</p>
<p><em>I&#x27;ll be honest with you, Mr. Thade. I&#x27;m a just man; I only punish those who deserve to be punished.<br>And you&#x27;re one of them.</em></p>
<p>--------------------</p>
<p><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzUzNzYyMzAucG5n/original/X6xgbk.png" loading="lazy"><br></p>
<p>--------------------<br></p>
<p>1-DC is the third installment of the &quot;N-digit computer&quot; saga, after <a href="https://89o.itch.io/6dc" target="_blank">The 6-digit computer</a> and <a href="https://89o.itch.io/1000-bit" target="_blank">1000-BIT</a>. It&#x27;s aimed to be as accessible and minimalist as possible.</p>
